---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="FoxMargin — Free Business Calculators & Document Generators"
  description="Free profit margin, break-even, markup calculators plus invoice, receipt, quote, and purchase order generators. Professional tools for small business. No signup."
>
  <div class="card">
    <h1>Free Business Tools</h1>
    <p>Professional calculators and document generators for small business owners. No signup, no watermarks — just results you can use.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section-heading">Document Generators</div>
  <div class="tools-grid">
    <a href="/invoice-generator/" class="tool-card tool-card-doc">
      <div class="tool-meta"><span class="tool-tag tool-tag-green">+ Logo & Profile</span></div>
      <h2>Invoice Generator</h2>
      <p>Professional invoices with your logo, line items, and tax. Print or save as PDF instantly.</p>
    </a>
    <a href="/receipt-generator/" class="tool-card tool-card-doc">
      <div class="tool-meta"><span class="tool-tag tool-tag-green">PAID Stamp</span></div>
      <h2>Receipt Generator</h2>
      <p>Create receipts with payment method, PAID stamp, and balance due. Perfect for any transaction.</p>
    </a>
    <a href="/quote-generator/" class="tool-card tool-card-doc">
      <div class="tool-meta"><span class="tool-tag">→ Convert to Invoice</span></div>
      <h2>Quote / Estimate Generator</h2>
      <p>Create professional quotes with validity date and acceptance block. Convert to invoice in one click.</p>
    </a>
    <a href="/purchase-order/" class="tool-card tool-card-doc">
      <div class="tool-meta"><span class="tool-tag">Authorization Block</span></div>
      <h2>Purchase Order Generator</h2>
      <p>Full POs with vendor, ship-to, delivery date, payment terms, and authorization signature.</p>
    </a>
  </div>

  <div class="section-heading" style="margin-top:1rem;">Calculators</div>
  <div class="tools-grid">
    <a href="/profit-margin-calculator/" class="tool-card">
      <div class="tool-meta"><span class="tool-tag">Most popular</span></div>
      <h2>Profit Margin Calculator</h2>
      <p>Calculate gross margin, net margin, and profit from revenue and cost.</p>
    </a>
    <a href="/break-even-calculator/" class="tool-card">
      <div class="tool-meta"></div>
      <h2>Break-Even Calculator</h2>
      <p>Find exactly how many units you need to sell to cover your costs.</p>
    </a>
    <a href="/markup-calculator/" class="tool-card">
      <div class="tool-meta"></div>
      <h2>Markup Calculator</h2>
      <p>Set the right price. Convert between markup percentage and profit margin.</p>
    </a>
  </div>

  <div class="card" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f2d52 0%,#1a4a82 100%);border:none;">
    <h2 style="color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Save Your Business Profile Once</h2>
    <p style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);margin-bottom:1rem;">Click "My Business" in the nav to save your logo, name, address, and contact info. Every document you create pre-fills automatically — your data stays in your browser, never on a server.</p>
    <button class="btn" onclick="openBizModal()" style="background:var(--fox-light);color:#fff;">Set Up My Business Profile</button>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .section-heading {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    padding-left: 0.1rem;
  }
  .tools-grid { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .tool-card {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-left: 3px solid transparent;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 1rem 1.3rem;
    color: var(--text);
    transition: border-color 0.15s, box-shadow 0.15s;
  }
  .tool-card:hover {
    border-left-color: var(--fox);
    box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(212,80,10,0.08);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .tool-card-doc { border-left-color: var(--border); }
  .tool-card-doc:hover { border-left-color: var(--fox); }
  .tool-meta { min-height: 1.4rem; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
  .tool-card h2 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--navy); margin-bottom: 0.2rem; }
  .tool-card p { font-size: 0.86rem; color: var(--muted); margin: 0; }
  .tool-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.67rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 0.1rem 0.45rem;
    border-radius: 3px;
    background: #fff3e0;
    color: var(--fox);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }
  .tool-tag-green { background: #e8f5e9; color: #2e7d32; }
</style>
